### GET APPLICATIONS
GET {{BASE_REQUEST}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

### POST APPLICATIONS
POST {{BASE_REQUEST}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "title": "Empresa 1",
    "type": "CMT",
    "company_id": 1
}

### GET COMPANIES
GET {{BASE_REQUEST}}/api/companies
Content-Type:application/json
Accept: application/json

### POST COMPANIES
POST {{BASE_REQUEST}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "UNINASSAU",
  "cnpj": "111111111111111",
